{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1178096-vulgar-effects","id":1178096,"title":"Vulgar Effects","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-22T10:27:38-08:00","id":1178096,"title":"Vulgar Effects","content":"Aspiring Mage ST here with a question.<br /> <br /> So, I think I understand the paradigms of all 9 Traditions pretty well in terms of philosophy and worldview, but every time I try to picture them, I run into a brick wall when I try to imagine what they look like when the gloves come off and Vulgar Magick is a necessary evil.<br /> <br /> I mean, some of them are easy. An Akashic starts catching bullets , a Hermetic shoots lightning out of their fingers, an Etherite breaks out their giant mech, etc.<br /> <br /> But what does it looks like when an Ecstatic or a Euthanatos is pushed to the point where concern about Paradox becomes secondary to just surviving? What does it look like when they &quot;go loud&quot;? Most of their stuff seems like it could pass for Coincidental.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T11:21:09-08:00","id":1178118,"title":"","content":"It depends...<br /> <br /> An Euthanatos could be as capable of catching bullets as an Akashic, as many do use martial arts. Other may shout a curse that kills the enemy on the spot. A really powerful Euthanatos invokes Kali and transforms his/her body into an avatar of the godess...<br /> <br /> You shouldn't think on terms of Traditions but on terms of Paradigm, which varies within Tradition. There's no hard limits to &quot;their stuff&quot;. Bring me a Paradigm complete with foci (or a Focus, to use M20 words) and I can elaborate on the vulgar effects I imagine such belief can bring forth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 01-22-2018, 02:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T11:53:49-08:00","id":1178133,"title":"","content":"Alright, that makes sense.<br /> <br /> So say we're operating on the standard &quot;higher consciousness through emotional experience&quot; paradigm for an Ecstatic, with all the associated foci (Sex, phychotropics, etc.) What would a Vulgar effect look like there? Actually, I could kinda' see how Time and Mind would parse out in those terms, but what does a Vulgar Forces or Correspondence effect look like under that Paradigm?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T12:31:03-08:00","id":1178148,"title":"","content":"Well, I would interpret the &quot;higher consciousness&quot; as allowing to break the boundaries of reality. If I visualize myself on home trough a drug trip or meditation I can reach that place on a single step, right trough the illusion of &quot;distance&quot;. If I'm angry physics bend to my Ire, I can scream with a force that would shatter bones or burn trough my touch. Consciousness it's always consciousness of &quot;something&quot;, and that thing it's what you can &quot;grab&quot;, so to speak, to warp reality. If you're more conscious of the bullets of your enemies, who says you can't &quot;grab&quot; them and turn them back from where they come?.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T12:36:10-08:00","id":1178150,"title":"","content":"Huh. I'd never thought of it like that. Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T14:25:01-08:00","id":1178194,"title":"","content":"For Ecstatics, imagine the sort of trippy things they might see. Now imagine them disgorging those perceptions out into the &quot;real&quot; world, where everyone else has to deal with it. This might involve illusion magic - with Forces or Mind - or it might involve altering Reality proper. It's how they get away with cloaking themselves in bits of altered Time, for instance. It's about realizing that one's internal reality, and the so-called external reality, have no true divisions; that the boundaries between are themselves illusory, and one can bleed through to another.<br /> <br /> So, to be brief, when an Ecstatic goes Vulgar, things get <i>Weird</i>.<br /> <br /> Reflections step out of mirrors and join the fray. Fires dance in the shape of people. Gravity gets inverted. People's positions and movements get blurry. Voices carry farther and shift erratically. Pink elephants and serpents appear. Environmental fixtures start <i>melting</i>. Folks start turning into animals, or grow new limbs. Everything starts changing color rapidly. Reality, put simply, is temporarily substituted for <i>Surreality</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":6156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","user":"Bluecho","date":". 01-22-2018, 05:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T14:50:49-08:00","id":1178213,"title":"","content":"Belly dance and then turn into a walrus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T16:42:24-08:00","id":1178265,"title":"","content":"Also, most Time effects other than Rank 1 and Rank 2 sensory effects are vulgar. Making time slow down or speed up a lot would definitely flip some people out.<br /> <br /> For the Euthantoi, the lack of decay or rapid decay using their signature sphere of Entropy could be vulgar.<br /> <br /> Vulgar magick is best described as 'the people in the area do a double take because that's not possible.'<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T16:45:36-08:00","id":1178268,"title":"","content":"For the Euthanatoi, being too lucky or having some destiny that seems implausible come true could be there. I'd think of horrible romantic movies like on Hallmark channel where the male and female protagonist are going to get together despite the fact they are horrible together and the plots are saccharine cliches. You could also have Horatios, that is stories of someone rising from weak and innocent to powerful be seen as implausible. The heroes do not always win. <br /> <br /> Of course, where you are has a great impact on whether something is vulgar or coincidental. Local reality matters, so smart mages work reality to avoid Paradox.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T17:37:00-08:00","id":1178286,"title":"","content":"Pushing a car to its limits, using manipulation of systems to keep it from breaking until they reach their destination. So when they finally stop, the car falls to pieces after they've walked three steps, like in the Blues Brothers.<br /> <br /> <br /> Although if the Euthanatos really want to go Vulgar, there's always the old standby: animating the dead. Not all of the Wheel-turners are hardcore into necromancy, but I suspect some of them are prepared to pull it out when the times get desperate. Same how, sometimes, you just need to reduce a man to dust with a death curse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T19:55:16-08:00","id":1178317,"title":"","content":"Well, I wrote up a Templar as a back-up character for an M20 game in case my Akashic bit the dust. In his case, one of his starting rotes was a Forces 3 straight-up kinetic damage Effect linked to a spray-n-pray action from his M60 (violence as focus). At this point you're thinking, &quot;how is this possibly vulgar?&quot;...well, the PC was a former gunny sergeant, and one of his foci was profanity.<br /> <br /> I'll be leaving now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T23:38:12-08:00","id":1178379,"title":"","content":"Oh, this looks like a fun exercise! Kinda like the finishing moves in a fighting game. I've got nothing to do, so here are some ideas for each Tradition and Convention using their primary sphere(s).<br /> <br /> <b>Akashayana</b>: a crazy graceful and fluid martial arts kata that makes Crouching Tiger look amateurish and inspires awe in everyone present.<br /> <br /> <b>Celestial Chorus</b>: call down an angel to enter your body, complete with glowing wings, halo of blinding light, and flaming sword that annihilates anything it strikes<br /> <br /> <b>Cult of </b><b>Ecstasy</b>: taking a drag of something WAY stronger than marijuana and exhaling a giant cloud at the enemy that induces horrifying hallucinations of the worst possible futures.<br /> <br /> <b>Dreamspeakers</b>: dragging an enemy into the spirit world and beating the crap out of their soul with the help of a predator spirit, like a lion or wolf.<br /> <br /> <b>Euthanatos</b>: cursing an enemy so their hopes, relationships, goals, home, possessions, body, mind, and spirit all fall apart. Like the Ten of Swords, but on every conceivable level.<br /> <br /> <b>Order of Hermes</b>: summoning the elemental spirits of wind, flame, ice, and stone to utterly destroy the enemy's body, mind, all of their magics, and possessions in one apocalyptic maelstrom of raw fury.<br /> <br /> <b>Sons of Ether</b>: warping the enemy through a dimensional portal to Etherspace and bombarding them with galvanic-cannons shooting acid bombs that melt the enemy on a metaphysical level.<br /> <br /> <b>Verbena</b>: calling up giant tree roots to drag the enemy underneath the earth and all the way to the roots of Yggdrasil, the World Tree, where they are devoured by the Nidhogg.<br /> <br /> <b>Virtual Adepts</b>: uploading themselves to the Digital Web, creating a kind of torture-Matrix, and locking the mind of the enemy inside it.<br /> __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ __<br /> <br /> <b>Iteration X:</b> use robot arms to catch, constrict, and dissect the target's body, turning them into another cog in the great Technocratic machine, while digitizing their brain patterns.<br /> <br /> <b>Progenitors</b>: beefing up with some instant, Hulk-level steroids and growing a massive scorpion tail that injects the enemy with a disease that rots them from the inside out.<br /> <br /> <b>New World Order:</b> basically the worst-end for Tradition mages. Abducted by Men in Black, taken to Room 101, and being mentally/emotionally/spiritually broken down until you're barely human.<br /> <br /> <b>Syndicate:</b> hostile takeover to dominate the enemy's mind, get them to blow all of their money/Quintessence on feeding the Syndicate, and trap them in a socio-economic situation where they literally bleed out their very existence until there is nothing left of them.<br /> <br /> <b>Void Engineers:</b> teleport to deep-space and tossing the enemy into the darkness of the Void, to be lost forever in the darkness between stars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10653-omegaz","name":"OmegaZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10653_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}